  "summary": "Honduran art is any artistic piece produced or that resembles the cultural patterns of the people of the Republic of Honduras, which has existed with the first presence of human beings within the modern Honduran territory.",
  "description": "Honduran art is any artistic piece produced or that resembles the cultural patterns of the people of the Republic of Honduras, which has existed with the first presence of human beings within the modern Honduran territory.\n\nHonduran art today consists of various artistic movements over the centuries that mixes both Euro-Western and indigenous elements with an especial influence from Afro-Caribbean groups such as the Garífuna. It consists of may techniques, such as realism, surrealism, cubism, abstraction, and more.",
